<h2 id="why">Why this site exists</h2>
<p>AI tools for doctors multiply every month, and most reviews are written by people who have never seen a patient. Doctors AI Tools exists so a busy clinician can see an honest, plain-language verdict from a physician, with real pricing and privacy checked.</p>

<h2 id="how-we-work">How we work</h2>
<ul>
<li>Every review is checked by our Chief Medical Editor before it is published.</li>
<li>We tell you when a tool has not been tested yet. We do not rank until we have.</li>
<li>We earn a commission from some links. It does not change our scores. <a href="/disclosure/">Read the disclosure</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>Read our <a href="/methodology/">review methodology</a> and <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>, or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
